diff --git a/AGENTS.md b/AGENTS.md
index 7765fed..42ee2d6 100644
--- a/AGENTS.md
+++ b/AGENTS.md
@@ -67,6 +67,15 @@ Allow people to move between OSS and SAAS Fizzy instances:
 - Must be able to handle very large ZIP files (500+GB)
 - Models in `app/models/account/data_transfer/`, `app/models/zip_file`
 
+### Internationalization
+
+Fizzy speaks English (the default) and Japanese:
+- Every readable string — including screen reader text, `title`/`aria-label`/`placeholder` attributes, flash messages, emails and push notifications — goes through I18n. Translations live in `config/locales/{en,ja}/*.yml`; `test/lib/locales_test.rb` checks every English key has a Japanese counterpart.
+- Opening any page with `?locale=ja` switches the session to Japanese and remembers the choice on the `Identity` (`CurrentLocale`). Unsupported locales are ignored. People who never chose a language get English.
+- Emails and push notifications use the recipient's language (`User#with_locale`), not the language of whoever triggered them. Webhooks always use the default language.
+- Strings rendered by JavaScript live in `app/javascript/helpers/locale_helpers.js`.
+- The static error pages in `public/` are bilingual.
+
 ## Coding style
 
 Before editing or reviewing code, read STYLE.md.
